 "summary": "Kamina territory (Haut-Lomami) is outside the active conflict areas of northern ex-Katanga; Mai-Mai/Bakata Katanga activity in 2026 was concentrated in neighbouring Bukama, Malemba-Nkulu and the Upemba area, not in Kamina. Kamina town is the provincial capital, with permanent PNC, FARDC and state administration, and hosted a presidential visit in July 2026. The Kamina military base (BAKA) south-east of town is an FARDC/FAC installation run by the army. Rural secteurs (Baka, Kinda, Songa) have no reported armed-group control and are assessed as default state presence (PNC).",
